{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9d47da66-974d-8309-b61a-1055f607a826",
  "created_at": "2025-12-09T10:55:52-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Manuel Pacheco",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:54:03-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:54:05-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, I'm calling about my recycling. The bin got left at the curb with a tag on it saying it was rejected, and I don't, I mean I didn't put anything weird in there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:54:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can help with that. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:54:21-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "31 Ruggles Avenue, up on the Hill. And this is the second miss in a row, so last week it wasn't picked up either, and, hang on, [pause] no, put that down, I'm on the phone. Sorry. Hi."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:54:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Do you remember what the tag said? Sometimes there's a checked box, like contamination or overflowing or bagged items."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:54:41-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, let me look, I have it right here. It says, it's got a box checked, plastic bags. But everything's loose in there. Well, mostly. There might have been one bag with the, the flattened cardboard stuff in it after the storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:54:55-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That could be it. Recycling has to go in loose, not inside bags, even paper or cardboard in a bag. Also, with the nor'easter Friday and Saturday there were delays all over, so some routes got pushed around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:55:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that was three days ago. Okay. So I take the bag out and put it back out when?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:55:15-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Empty out the bag, keep the bin at the curb, and I'll put in a note for a recheck on your street. Otherwise you'd hold it for your next regular pickup."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:55:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that works. Wow, everybody seems to be calling today, I was on hold, what, a few minutes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:55:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's been busy since the storm. Is this the best number if the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:55:40-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, 401-555-0190."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:55:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0190. I've noted 31 Ruggles Avenue for a recheck."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:55:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, thanks. I'll pull the bag out right now. Bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:55:50-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for calling. Bye now."
    }
  ],
